---
title: "flash_loan - Flash Loan (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version_check: check version matches
    q_version_check --> q_check_pool: version valid
    q_version_check --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: revert

    q_check_pool --> q_borrow: pool has sufficient liquidity
    q_check_pool --> q_error_liquidity: insufficient liquidity
    q_error_liquidity --> [*]: revert

    q_borrow --> q_create_receipt: withdraw loan_amount from pool
    q_create_receipt --> q_user_operations: create FlashLoanReceipt(loan_amount, fee)

    q_user_operations --> q_repay_check: user performs arbitrary operations within same PTB
    q_repay_check --> q_calc_fee: FlashLoanReceipt consumed (hot potato pattern)
    q_calc_fee --> q_verify_repay: flash_loan_fee = loan_amount * 0.1%

    q_verify_repay --> q_update_pool: repay_amount >= loan_amount + flash_loan_fee
    q_verify_repay --> q_error_underpay: repayment insufficient
    q_error_underpay --> [*]: revert (hot potato not consumed)

    q_update_pool --> q_protocol_income: pool.available += repay_amount
    q_protocol_income --> [*]: protocol_income += flash_loan_fee, return excess to borrower

    note right of q_create_receipt
        INV-001: FlashLoanReceipt is a hot potato (must be consumed in same transaction)
        INV-002: no collateral required for flash loans
    end note

    note right of q_verify_repay
        INV-003: repay_amount >= loan_amount + flash_loan_fee (atomicity enforced)
        INV-004: flash_loan_fee = 0.1% of loan_amount
        INV-005: if repay fails, entire transaction reverts (no partial state change)
    end note

    note right of q_update_pool
        INV-006: pool balance after >= pool balance before (net positive from fee)
        INV-007: flash loan duration is 0 seconds (same transaction)
    end note
